  "body": "SPYTube v1.5 — Major streaming \u0026 download overhaul:\n- **Peachify Player**: New primary streaming player (peachify.top/embed/) replacing old Cinefy player.\n- **4 Streaming Servers**: Peachify (primary), ZXCStream, Videasy, VidLink — all iframe-based with TMDB ID.\n- **4KHDHub Downloads**: New download source with HubCloud bypass for 4K/1080p/720p content.\n- **3-Way Parallel Download Fetch**: VidVault + 4KHDHub + HiCine fetched simultaneously.\n- **ISP Bypass Client**: Unified 3-layer bypass (DoH + TLS 1.3 + CF Worker proxy).\n- **PRDownloader**: Replaced Android DownloadManager with PRDownloader for reliable resume/retry.\n- **Download Manager UI**: Full download tracking with pause/resume/refresh/delete.\n- **Resume Playback**: Save \u0026 restore playback position via CinefyCache.\n- **JSoup Scraping**: Added JSoup for 4KHDHub HTML parsing.\n- **Local File Playback**: Play downloaded MKV files directly in CinefyPlayer."
